    texte: "Allâhu Allâhu Allâhu Allâh\n   Allâhu Allâh Lâ -ilâha -illa Llâh\n     Allâhu Allâhu Allâhu Allâh\n    Allâhu Allâhu ṣarriḥ wa nâdî\n  Allâhumma ṣalli ‘alâl Muṣṭafâ x2\nḤabîbnâ Muḥammed ‘alayhi ssalâm x2\n\n  Tachâwwaqat rûḥî li chaṭṭil wâdî\n Fahâ -ana dhâ Ḥamza khudh biyadî\n      -Abîtu llayâlî jahrân -unâdî\n  Wa qalbî yadhûbu minal kamadi\n  Ramânil ‘udhdhâlu bifarṭil hawâ\n      Wa qâlû juninta fawâ jaladî\n  Maḥabbatu Llâhi nârun mûqada\n      Tubîdu birrûḥi wa bil jasadî\nFadharratu ḥubbin lilmawlâ rraḥîm\n  Tuzîlul humûma yawma ttanâdî\n     ‘achiqtul -ilâha wa lâ ṣabra lî\n     Fa ḥurqatu ḥubbihi fil fu-âdî\n   -Uḥibbuka yâ mubdi‘al kâ-inât\n   Wa ḥaqqika rabbi -anta murâdî\n   Lakal ḥamdu rabbi ‘alâ kulli ḥâl\n      Fa -antal wâḥidu bilâ ‘adadi\n Yâ -ahlal hâwa wa Llâhi -innakum\n    Fî ladhîdhi ‘aychin -ilâl -abadi\nFa kayfa lâ yaltadhdhu man qaṣduhu\n     Bulûghul wiṣâli -ilâ ṣṣamadi\n\n   Hanî-an rifâqî wa bûchrâ lanâ\n  Bibaḥrin lujiyyin minal madadi\n      Kasâkal -ilâhu jalâla ṣṣafâ\n    Wa -aẓhara sirraka lil ‘ibâdi\n   Fanilta bifaḍlin maqâma rrijâl\n     Wa ṣirta ‘abîdan ilâl –aḥadi\n   Sami‘ta nnidâ-a wa -a‘lantahu\n Fayâ Ḥamza ‘abdî ṣarriḥ wa nâdî\n  Hanî-an li ‘aynin ra-at sirrakum\n  Wa jafnin salîmin mina rramadi\n   Ḥabâkal -ilâhu -anwâral hâdî\n   Yâ –âsil qulûba mina nnakadi\n Dhariftu ddumû‘a wa -arsaltuhâ\n    -Urîdu ddukhûla -ilal baladi\n Fa qad ‘arrasa rrakbu bibâbikum\n   Wa -alqâ ‘aṣâhu minal kamadi\n    Bi rabbil barî-ati -innî lakum\n   Muṭi‘un li -amrikumu sayyidî\n   -Ayâ ḥâdiya nnûqi rifqan bihâ\nFaṭaybatun fâḥat bi Muḥammadî\nWali‘tu bi khayril warâ khuluqan\nWa khalqan rabbâhu -irḥam kabidî\n  -Ayâ ṣâḥibal ḥawḍi -anta lladhî\n   Naẓarta jamâla man lam yalidi\n     -Arâkal -ilâhu min -âyâtihi\n   Mâ -athlaja ṣadraka yâ sayyidî\n ‘ajiztu ‘anil mad_ḥi wa ththanâ-i\n\nFayâ rabbi zid_hu mina ssu-dadi\n  -Ayâ rabbi ṣalli ‘alal –amîni\nMuḥammadi lhâdî -ilâ rrachâdi\n Wa -âlihi jam‘an wa ‘ichratihi\n  -Ûlil ‘izzi wa ṣṣabri fil jihâdi",
