    texte: "Allâhu Allâh Allâhu Allâh\n       Allâhu Allâh lâ -ilâha -illa Llâh\n      ‘Allamûnî kayfal masîru -ilâ Llâh\n        Wa qâlû khudhi rriḍa-a tîjânâ\n       Qad raḍaynâ billâhi lâ bisiwâhu\n      Mâ laqînâ lammâ raḍaynâ hâwanâ\n    Lî bihi quwwatun wa lî minhu lutfun\n       Wa lihâdha -aral ḥaṣâta jumânâ\n     Wa laqad –adraknâl yaqîna ṣighârâ\n     Wa kabirnâ wa mâ jahilnâl mâ kâna\n  Wa –adhkharnâl yaqîna lilḥachri dhukhran\n     Wa mala-nâ mina ththabâti jinânâ\n    Ḥilyatu nnâssi jawharun wa ‘uqûdun\n       Wa tuqâ Llâhi yâ rijâlu ḥulânâ\n      Wa labisnâ minal ḥayâ-i chi‘âran\n       Wa ja‘alnâhu fawqanâ ṭîlisanâ\n    Qad ‘alimnâ annal maḥabbata kanzun\n      Kullu man ṣânahâ samâ bunyânâ\n\n   -Anâ law -achrabul biḥâra jami‘an\n   Lam -azal fî maḥabbatihi ẓam-ânâ\n  Lastu –urwâ -illâ biluqyâka yâ Rabb\n    Wa hâdha lliqâ-u -asmâ rajânâ\n  Wa ‘alaynâ minal Muhaymini ‘aynun\n   -Awsa‘atnâ taḥaqquqan wa ‘iyânâ\n   Wa lanâ qad –udîra khamru ttajallî\n    Wa bihi ṣâra kâ-sunâ mal-ânâ\nWa chahidnâl wujûda ḥawḍan wa kânat\n     Ṣuwarul kulli ‘indanâ kîsânâ\n-inna man nâla charbatan minhu yawman\n      Lâ tarâhu ‘alâl madâ ẓam-âna\n Ḥawḍu khayril –anâmi ‘adhbun zulâlun\n   Sâ-ighun bâridun liman yata‘ânâ\n  Baynanâ wa‘duhu ‘alâl ḥawḍi nalqâ\n   Ṣâḥibal ḥawḍi mithlamâ yalqânâ\n   Wa biwajhil malîḥi sirru chuhûdin\n    ‘Anhu mâ zâlatil warâ ‘umyânâ\n      Ḍalla ‘anhu –iblîsu jâhilan\n     Wa –abâ ‘an kamâlihi nuqṣânâ\n     -ilayhi htadat mâlâ-ikatu Llâhi\n        Wa zâdat bi-amrihi –îqânâ\n\n Kun bihi ‘ârifan wadum bih mughraman\n    Wa taqarrab lahu takun –insânâ\n   -innahul bâbu lâkinnal fat_ḥa ṣa‘bun\nZâda qawman khawfan wa qawman –îmânâ\n  Ka-su ḥusnin wa ka-su ‘ichqin wa –in\n   Nî Bihimâl –âna lam –azal sakrânâ\n     Hidhihi fîl ‘umûmi jumlatu ḥâlî\n     Wa ta‘âlâ man –anzalal furqânâ\n      Wa li-ahlil khuṣûṣi fî maqâmi\n      Kulli ḥâlin fî dhâtihi yatafânâ",
