    texte: "Yâ raṣûla Llâh yâ ḥabîba Llâh x2\n      -Anta li ‘awnun yawma el qalah\n    Qamarun min fawqi ghuṣni naqâ x2\n      Yanjalî subḥâna man khalaqa\n      Hadhihil –akwânu ṭal‘atuhu x2\n       Kulu man qad hâma fihi raqâ\n     Yâ barîqa lghawri qif nafasan x2\n     Qad khaṭaftal qalba wal ḥadaqa\n    -In tajuz yawman bidhi salamin x2\n        Qul lahum jûdû bi ba‘di liqâ\n     Lî fu-âdun mil-uhu chaghafun x2\n        Wa ḍulû‘un ḥuchiyat ḥaraqa\n     Wa ‘uyûnun kullamâ ramaqat x2\n     Lam yada‘ minhal ḥawâ ramaqa\n   Qul lahum yâ sa‘da mughramukum x2\n      Kam yuqâsi ddam‘a wal -araqa\n   Dhâba chawqan fi maḥabbatikum x2\n     Ḥîna minkum bâriqun baraqa\n\nChamsu hâdhal kawni ṭâli‘atun x2\n  Jadhabat rûḥa lladhî ramaqa\n  Dhâtuhâ min dhâti lâbisihâ x2\n  Wa humâ fî nnach-ati ftaraqâ\n Wa hya min –anwâri bahjatihi x2\n    Bil ‘aṭâyâ tamla-ul –ufuqa\n Ḥannatil –arwâḥu ḥîna badat x2\nMithla ma‘chûqin wa man ‘achaqa\nThumma râḥal jismu muḍṭariban x2\n Chamma rîḥal –amri fantachaqa\n   Wa ḥanînul far‘i lâ ‘ajaba x2\n   Naḥwa –aṣlin bismihi naṭaqa\n  Yâ nusaymâtin sarat saḥaran x2\n Min chadhâhal kawnu qad ‘abaqa\n  Khabbirînâ ‘an –aḥibbatinâ x2\n   Wa ‘anil –ahlîna wa rrufaqâ\n  Layta man bil jid‘i law aṭafû x2\n  Layta man –ahwâhu bî rafaqa\n  Dam‘atî bissafḥi min –iḍami x2\n  Safaḥat yawma nnawâ qalaqâ\n   Yâ ‘adhûlî kuffa ‘an ‘adhlî x2\n-inna hâdhâ llawma maḥḍu chaqâ\n\n Law tarâ mâ qad ra-aytu lamâ x2\n   Lumta fî sâqin hawâhu saqâ\nFî nawâḥî chchu‘abi ghâniyatun x2\n   Ḥusnuhâ fîl kawni mâ ttafaqa\n  -Aynamâ lâḥat sajadtu lahâ x2\n Ḥaythu dhâba kullî wa nmaḥaqa\n   Wa –anâ lfânî falâ ‘ajaba x2\n   Kayfa lî minhâ biwaṣfi baqâ",
