    debut: 395,
    fin: 398,
    texte: "Madhâgh\nQA S I DA E N D I A L E C TA L ( DA R I J A )\n\n        Allâh Allâh Allâh\n         Allâh yâ mawlânâ\n        Allâh Allâh Allâh\n        Wa ssirru fî Madhâgh\n\n       Madhâgh (x3) ‘Anhâ qalbî mâ râgh\n  Wa lâ baṣarî zâgh Thamma chcharâbu sâgh\n  -Anwâru thamma tlûḥ Wa –achdhâ-u tafûḥ\n    Wa lâ nachwa lirrûḥ -illâ fî ḥân madhâgh\n    Farrawḥu wa rrayḥân Wa jannatul ‘irfân\n  Wa mulṭaqâ nnadmân Hunâka fî Madhâgh\n    Fa man yurîd charba Min fayḍil maḥabba\n     Fal yaṭlubi ṣṣuḥba Hunâka fî Madhâgh\n    Wa man yabghî sacra Bi khamratil ḥaḍra\n    Fa ssâqî wal khamra Hunâka fî Madhâgh\nThamma chamsul ‘irfân Wa ma-dhûnu Rrahmân\n   Ḥamza quṭbu zzamân Fa ṭuba li Madhâgh\n   Fa mâ Ḥamza siwâ Khamra yâ man tahwâ\n   Fada ‘ ‘anka ssiwâ Wa qṣid ḥâna Madhâgh\n    Buchrâhu yâ munâh Man Ḥamzata saqâh\nMan lam ya ‘rif nafsah Man lam ya ‘rif Madhâgh\n   Charâbuhu mu ‘taq Min qalbi –an nukhlaq\n    Man dhâquh yatḥaqqaq Wa t_hîm rûḥûb\n                    Madhâgh\n Fa kam minal ‘uchchâq Min khamratihâ dhâq\n  Fa sammâhâ madhâq Badîlan ‘an Madhâgh\n Fada ‘ qîlan wa qâl Wa ṣ_ḥab chaykhal kamâl\n   Litarchufa zzulâl Min Kawthari Madhâgh\n   Fa yâ qâṣid Rabbî Wa mchawwaq lil qurbi\n     Fal bâbu lil ḥubbi Hunâka fî Madhâgh\n\n     Yâ ṭâlibal wuṣûl -isma ‘ limâ –aqûl\n-iṣ_ḥab faḥlal fuḥûl Wa qṣid lahu Madhâgh\n  Ḥamza wa mâ –adrâk Bihi tudrik Mûlâk\n   -in taṣdaq fî hawâk Fa sâri‘ li Madhâgh\n Fa tanjû min mawjât Khiḍammi ẓẓulumât\n  Ḥaqqan ‘aynal ḥayât Tafûru fî Madhâgh\n    Fanhaḍ bil kulliyya Wa –akhliṣi nniya\n Wa ḥuththal maṭiyya Liwijhati Madhâgh\n   Tajid bilâ rtiyâb Ḥamza quṭbul –aqṭâb\n  Al mâ-u lâ ssarâb Wa yarwâ fî Madhâgh\n Fa –akhliṣ lahul wudd Wa ḥâfiẓ ‘alâl ‘ahd\nWa ‘affir minkal khadd Bi turbati Madhâgh\nWa khruj ‘anil –afhâm Wa sallimhu zzimâm\n Yaqudka lil marâm Wa tas ‘ad bi Madhâgh\n   Wa –in sa-alta –ayn Ṣafiyyal ḥaḍratayn\nQul majma ‘al baḥrayn Hunâka fî Madhâgh\n    Ḥamzal quṭbul farîd Bihi kullu murîd\n  Yanâl kull mâ yurîd Fa ssirru fî Madhâgh\n      Fafî tilka ddiyâr Tafajjarul –anhâr\n  Wa tanba ‘ul –asrâr Fa bûrikat Madhâgh\n  Fa Llâhumma ḥbibnâ Fî Ḥamza –innanâ\n  -iyyâka qaṣadnâ Lammâ ji-nâ Madhâgh\n  Wa hâ naḥnu bil bâb Faqbal ‘alâl –aḥbâb\n  Wa kullu man –ajâb Dâ ‘îka fî Madhâgh\n     Wa ṣalli yâ wahhâb ‘Alâ tâjil –aqṭâb\n Wal –âli wa ṣṣiḥâb Wal ḥubbu fî Madhâgh\n  Wa tammim bi ssalâm ‘Alâ hâdîl –anâm\n\nWa ṣaḥbihil kirâm Khuṣûsan fî Madhâgh",
