    texte: "-Achraqal kawnu wa zahâ\n     Wa bi-Aḥmad tabâhâ\n   Ghannat larwâḥu chawqâ\n      Binûril hâdî Ṭâha\n    Ḥirtu fîl –amri yâ khillî\n    Lammâ khallat waṣlahâ\n   ‘Abra naẓratin minal ḥubbi\n     Tuḥyî rrûḥa wa hawâhâ\n   Thumma ṣiḥtu –âh yâ Rabbî\n   -Anta lladhî man sawwâhâ\n     Wajjahtu –ilayka qalbî\n     Bidhdhikri lisânî fâhâ\n     Lâ talumnî yâ ‘adûllî\n   Ghuḍḍal ‘ayna wa ṭarfahâ\n    Law ta‘lamu sirral qurbi\n     Judta binnafs kullahâ",
