    sousTitre: "chant n° 309 · p. 553",
    debut: 553,
    fin: 553,
    texte: "-Antal ‘alîmu biḥâlî\n  Fa lâ tukhayyib su-âlî\n  Sa-altukal ‘afwa ‘annî\n Wa ‘an dhunûbî ththiqâli\n Yâ ḍay‘atal ‘umri lammâ\n  -Anfaqtuhu fîl muḥâli\n  -Anfaqtuhu fîl khaṭâyâ\n  Wa fîl hawâ wa ḍḍalâli\n   Yâ Rabbi dâwi fu-âdî\n   Min kulli dâ-in ‘uḍâli\n   Yâ Rabbi yassir ḥisâbî\n  Yâ Rabbi –aḥsin ma-âlî\n  Bijâhi –akrami ‘abdin\n    ‘Alayka fî kulli ḥâli\n   ‘Alayhi –alfu ṣalâtin\n  Fîn mithlihâ bittiṣâli",
