    debut: 565,
    fin: 566,
    texte: "‘Ajanû miskal jamâli\n    Biraḥîqil ḥubbi ṣirfâ\n  Wa banaw lil ḥubbi fîhi\n  Ka‘batan samrâ-a hayfâ\n  Munyatun ḥajjat –ilayhi\n   -Alṭaful –arwâḥi zulfâ\n  ‘Achaqatnî mazzaqatnî\n    Bijamâlin zâda luṭfâ\n   Tilka baytu Llâhi fîhi\n Qad wajadnâ ssirra kachfâ\n  Fa ‘arafnâ Llâha jahrân\n   Yatajallâ laysa yukhfâ\n  Mâ –atâhâ ghayru ‘abdin\n   Bu‘uhûdil ḥubbi wafâ\n Muḥramu dhdhâti khalî‘an\n  Qad ta‘arrâ wa takhaffâ\n\nQâla lîl maḥbûbu ‘anhâ\nLâ tabuḥ bi ssirri tajfâ\n Kayfa –ajfâ wa ḥabîbî\nYa‘lamu ssirra wa -akhfâ",
