    texte: "Hâdhihi chumûsu laylâ cha‘cha‘at\n  Salabat –anwâruhâ kulla ddurar\n   Kachafat biruq‘ihâ ‘an wajhihâ\n Fa tasallaw yâ ‘uchchâqu binnaẓar\n -in taqul chamsun fa ba‘ḍu nûrihâ\n-Aw budûr –aw kawâkib –aw qamar\n  -Aw taqul hiya chumûsul ihtidâ-\n  -Aw hiyal baydâ-u labisat fakhar\n   -Aw taqul hiya ssamâwâtul ‘ulâ\n -Aw hiyal ‘âlam ‘aynan –aw –athar\nKhajilat chamsu ḍḍuḥâ min sanâhâ\n Kullu ḥusnin min bahâhâ sta‘âr\n   Fâqat ḥûral khuldi fî quṣûrihâ\n  Bal hiyal jannatu fitnatul bachar\nBil bahâ wal ḥusni wa zzaynil badî‘\nMin –asrârin wa –anwârin wa zzahar\n  Kullu dhâka râchiḥun min ṭîbihâ\n   Li jamâlil wajhi fâza man naẓar\n\n   ‘Ajaban narâhâ fî waḥdatihâ\n Wa kathîran taẓ_haranna fî ṣṣuwar\n   Ṭawatil –akwâna fî asrârihâ\nDhâba thaljul wahmi fî baḥri zakhar\n     -in tajallat biṣṣifâti ‘urifat\n-Aw kâna bidhdhâti lam yabqa diyâr\n   Hiya dhâtî wa hiya ‘aynu ṣifâtî\n Wa hiya ma‘nâya wa ḥissî wal baṣar\n  Kam qitâlun wa jihâdun dûnahâ\n Qalîlun –idhâ badâl wajhul –agharr\nKam saqat nadmânahâ min khamratin\n   Kam qatîlin biliḥâẓihâ ndathar\n    -Ajbaratnî lissujûdi ṣaṭwatun\n   -Afnatnî ‘annî fafuztu bil waṭar\n -Afraghat ‘alayhi ḥuliyyan jûduhâ\n Kam wa kam min ni‘am lâ tanḥaṣir\n  Fa hiya dhâtul kulli wal kullu bihâ\nLahu ma‘nan khafiyyu chay- mu‘tabar\n  Hanî-an lidhdhâ-iqîna khamrahâ\n  Ḥaythu tarakû ḍḍamira mustatir",
