    texte: "-idhâ kâna kullî dâ-iman yuchbihul barqa\n Faqulli hunâ man dhâ yadûmu wa man yabqâ\n   Wa mâ dhâlikal bâqî siwâ Llâhu waḥdahu\n  Fa mâ bâlu aqwâmin yusammûnanî khalqâ\n  Tajaddadtu ‘an –amrin qadîmin wa –innanî\n-Anâl ḥâdithul mawhûmu wa chchabaḥul mulqâ\n     Wa rûḥî wa ‘aqlî lil wujûdi marâtib\n Wa nafsî wa jismî taṣ_ḥabul jam ‘a wal farqa\n -Ana chchamsu fî waṣfil kamâli wa mâ ssiwâ\n   Siwa ẓẓilli fastayqin ‘alayhi lîya ssabqa\n    Fa-in chi-ta lî fa‘rif jamî ‘a manâzilî\n  Wa da‘ ‘ankal gharba was taqbili chcharqa\n  Hiya dhdhâtu ‘an dâlin wa ‘an –alifin ‘alat\n   Wa tâ-in falâ tadrîl ḥurûfu lahâ marqâ\n   Ḥijâziyyatun châmiyyatun dhâtu ṭal ‘atin\n    ‘Alat man ra-âhâ lâ yaẓillu wa lâ yachqâ\n   Wa lâ zâlatil –arwâḥu tasmû bihimmatî\n   Wa sirru majâlil ghaybi lâ zâla bî yarqâ\n\n -idhâ ḥtajabat mitnâ wa ‘ichnâ –ichâ badat\n   Wa –in-afraṭat fîl hajri qulnâ lahâ rifqâ\n    Sajadnâ lahâ wahiya râki ‘atun lanâ\n  Bimayli murîdin nâchiqin ṭîbahâ nachqâ\nHiyal wasmu wa rrasmu wal jamâlu ḥaqîqatan\n   Fa-ayna mâ wallaytu –ach_haduhâ talqâ\n   Wa qad qaṣurat ‘anhâ tarâkîbu fi‘lihâ\n  Wa –iṭlâquhâ yastawjibul fatqa wa rratqa\n   Tanazzahat ‘an tilkal marâtibi kullihâ\n  Fa saḥqan li ‘abdin laysa ya ‘rifuhâ saḥqa",
