    texte: "-ista‘mili ṣṣabra tajnî ba‘dahul ‘asala\n   Wa fî dujâ llayli fanhaḍ wa hjuril kasala\n    Wa qif tujâha rasûli Llâhi mubtahilâ\n   Wa lâzimil bâba ḥattâ tablughal –amala\n Wa chudda raḥlaka wa qṣid naḥwa ḥaḍratihi\n  Wa ḥmil limarḍâtihi fîl ḥubbi kulla balâ\n     Famâ yafûzu biwaṣlin yâ –akhî siwâ\nMan kâna fîl ḥubbi dawman yaḥmilu ththaqala\n  Wa marrighil khadda fî –a‘tâbi ḥaḍratihi\n  Fa –inna –a‘tâbahu ḥiṣnun liman dakhala\n     Hâdhâl ḥabîbu yunâjî fî ddujâ saḥarâ\n Hal min muqillin ‘alayhi ddahru qad bakhala\n   -in kunta tarjû nawâlan min makârimihi\n  Fanhaḍ wa kun rajulan bissa‘yi qad waṣala",
