    texte: "Kullu waqtin min ḥabîbî\n     Qadruhu ka-alfi ḥajja\nFâza man khalla chchawâghil\n   Wa li mawlâhu tawajjah\n Kuntu qablal yawma ḥâ-ir\n    Fî zawâyâl kawni dâ-ir\n     Fî biḥâril fikri mulqâ\n  Bayna –amwâjil khawâṭir\n    Wa lladhî kâna murâdî\n   Lam yazal fîl qalbi ḥâḍir\n   Kachafa ssitra ‘an ‘aynî\n     Wa badâ fî kulli bahja\nFâza man khalla chchawâghil\n   Wa li mawlâhu tawajjah\n     Jama‘a Llâhu chutâtî\n      Wa tawâlat faraḥâtî\n  Wa ghadâ maḥbûbu qalbî\n     ‘Aynu dhâtî wa ṣifâtî\n     Yâ surûrî wa nti‘âchî\n     Wa yâ dawâma ḥayâtî\nLastu ba‘dal yawmi –akhchâ\n  -Âminan min salbi muhja\nFâza man khalla chchawâghil\n   Wa li mawlâhu tawajjah\n    -Anâ maḥbûbul qulûbi\n   -Aṣbaḥal yawma naṣîbî\n\n      Wa tajallâ sirruhu lî\n      Lil ‘iyâni min qarîbi\n    Fachtâqû ṭal‘ata wajhî\n     Litaraw wajha ḥabîbî\n Hâkadhâl waṣlu wa ka-ann\n  Lam yakun wa Llâhi ḥujja\nFâza man khalla chchawâghil\n   Wa li mawlâhu tawajjah\n  -Anâ machghûlun bidhâtî\n      ‘An jamî ‘il kâ-inâti\n   Lam –azal bayna ṣṣuḥâti\n      Mutawâlî ssakarâti\n  Ghâ-iban ‘an kulli –aynin\n      Fî jamî ‘il khaṭarâti\n  -Anâ min ‘uchchâqi waqtî\n    Fîl hawâ –asidu nahjah\nFâza man khalla chchawâghil\n   Wa li mawlâhu tawajjah\n      Lâ takhâfû yâ ṣiḥâbî\n    Ba‘da hâdhâ min ‘itâbi\n     -Anâ maḥbûbî tajallâ\n   Wa njalâ min dûn niqâbi\n    Mujarrad laysa ‘alayhi\n  Malbasun ghayru thiyâbî\n   Hâ –anâ min kulli wajhi\n  ‘indahu wa Llâhu –awjah\nFâza man khalla chchawâghil\n\nWa li mawlâhu tawajjah",
