    texte: "Mâ madda likhayril khalqi yadâ\n   -Aḥadun –illâ wa bihi sa ‘idâ\n  Falidhâka madadtu –ilayhi yadî\n Wa bidhâlika kuntu mina ssu ‘adâ\n     Bâbun lillâhi samâ wa ‘alâ\n   Charafan wa mtâza bikulli ‘ulâ\n   Wal kullu bida ‘watihi ṭṭaṣala\n   Billâhi wa ḥâza bihil madada\n      -innî fîl ‘usri wa fîl yusri\n  Biḥimâhu –alûdhu madâl ‘umuri\n  Wa –aqûlu –aghithnî yâ dhukhrî\n   Wa –anilnî min kaffayka nadâ\n   Wa ‘alaynâ ta’aṭṭaf yâ –amalî\n    Bi chifâ-il qalbi minal ‘ilali\n  -Ayakûnu muḥibbuka fî wajali\n  Wa bijâhika lâ nakhchâ –aḥadâ\n     Lâ –arjû ghayraka –in jâra\n     Dahrî wa ‘udimat lanṣâri\n\n   Biḥayâtika –alqil –anẓâra\nKaraman yâ –afḍala man sajada\n-Antal mukhtâru minal qidami\n Yâ khayra chafî ‘in fîl –umami\nWa binûrika min ba ‘dil ‘idami\nWajhu ttakwîni zahâ wa badâ\n Wa ṣalâtu Llâhi bilâ ḥiṣarin\n Laka tuhdâ yâ sâmîl qadari\n Wal –âli m ‘a ṣṣaḥbil ghurri\n Mâ –abdâ ṭṭâ-iru taghrîdâ",
