    texte: "Nûru Llâhi yu‘ṭâ\n     Lil qulûbi min bâṭinî\n    Fa kun ḥarîṣan ‘alayhi\n     Yâ murîdan lâ taghfal\n       Fa-anâ tâ-ihun fî\n   Ḥadratil qudsi dâ-iman\n  Wa –asrâru Llâhi tahubb\n    ‘Alayya min kull jânib\n    Fa-in qaṣadtanî tajidnî\n         ‘Aynal ḥaqîqati\n    Khâliyal qalbi min kull\n    -Aghrâḍi nnafsâniyya\n Lâbisan ḥulalal ḥaḍratayn\n    Bifaḍli Muḥammadin\nFa lâ taqṣid yâ murîd –an tnâl\n   Hadhî rrutab bil khidma\n     Tdhallalnâ lejmî‘ rjâl\n     Allâh faṣirnâl hâ ahlâ\nMin ghayr tadbîr wa lâ khtiyâr\n      Min ḥaythu lâ nadrî\n   Fatjallat lanâ ḥrûf Allah\n      Fî jamî ‘al –achyâ-i\n  Fanqalab l-amr –ilâ ghayr\n       Mâ kunnâ nafham\n     Faṣirnâ dakkan kamâ\n        -Arâda Rabbunâ\n     Fahâdhâ chrâba rrijâl\n\n    Lladhîna dhâqû churbahâ\nWa qaṣadnâ bâbahum wa qabbalnâ\nNi‘alhum wa nilnâ minhum wafrâ\n    Wa –in lam tadhuq hâdhâ\n     Falâ taqul –anâ minhum\nFahuwa wahmun yetkhayyal lak\n   Wa taḥsab –annak ‘alâ ḥaqq\n   Wa –akthir min dhikri Llâh\n      -ilâ –an yanflaqa ṣṣubḥ\n Wa taẓ_har lak lachyâ- wâḍ_ḥa\n Min ghayr tadbîr wa lâ khtiyâr\n    Wa qṣid mâ qaṣadnâ tafnâ\n We tabqâ we hadhâ mqâma rrjâl\n    Wa khla‘ na‘layka ‘an kull\n Mâ yachghlak ‘an qiblat laḥrâr\n       Fa ṣallî ṣalâtal ‘ârifîn\n     Taẓ_har lak jamî‘ lasrâr\n    Wa ṣalli wa sallim yâ Rabbî\n            ‘Ala nnabiyyi\n Wa ṣṣaḥbi wa man yatba‘uhum\n      -ilâl ḥachri min laḥrâr",
